sequenceDiagram
    participant V as 学习页面
    participant C as LearnController
    participant S as LearnService
    participant R as RecordService
    participant M as MasteryService
    participant D as 数据库
    V->>C: 提交答案
    C->>S: submit(itemId, answers)
    S->>D: 读取题目和正确答案
    Note over S: 逐题判分
    S->>R: saveAnswers(item, results)
    R->>D: 写入 answer_record
    S->>M: update(学生, 题目)
    M->>D: 找到题目关联的知识点
    M->>D: 重算并写入 mastery
    M-->>S: 每个知识点前后变化
    S-->>V: 成绩、解析、掌握度变化
    Note over V,D: 之后打开推荐页、干预页时，读取最新掌握度
